kubeos-pause-image (3.10.2-3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add the #DEBHELPER# marker to postinst. Without it dh_installdeb silently inserts no
    snippets at all - no systemd reload, no unit enablement, no dpkg-maintscript helpers - and
    the package looks fine because the shipped .wants links start the units anyway. Found while
    packaging kubeos-containerd; kubeos-storage is the one here that ships units.

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0530

kubeos-pause-image (3.10.2-2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Debian revision numbering: 3.10.2-1kubeos1 -> 3.10.2-2. The revision is a plain Debian one now
    instead of the 1kubeosN prefix the first uploads used; the upstream version is
    unchanged. The KubeOS distribution version lives in kubeos-base, which is 0.2.0.
  * Note the revision: 3.10.2-1 would sort BELOW 3.10.2-1kubeos1 (a revision that is a
    prefix of another sorts first), so the plain revision here is -2 - -1 would never
    install as an upgrade on a node that already has the old one.

 -- KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:00:00 +0530

kubeos-pause-image (3.10.2-1kubeos1) trixie; urgency=medium

